# Normalise everything to LF in the repository.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The site is built by Cloudflare's Linux builders and the deploy
# scripts run on Linux hosts; a shell script checked in with CRLF fails there with a
# "bad interpreter" error that names the wrong cause. Authoring happens on Windows, so
# without this the first commit from a machine with core.autocrlf unset would break the build.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit for the ones where a stray CR is fatal rather than merely untidy.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
